    "eventContactName": "John Friederich",
    "eventDetail": "<p>Speaker: Mike Helbock, M.I.C.P., NR-P, SEI </p>\r\n<p>High-performance CPR has been demonstrated to improve survival from cardiac arrest. At its core, high-performance CPR is a process of using insights from data and observation to continuously improve resuscitation performance. Mike Helbock, M.I.C.P., NR-P, SEI, is one of the original creators of the high-performance CPR concept. </p>\r\n<p>At this webinar, Mike will help you integrate Pit Crew CPR into high-performance CPR, build a culture to support the need for regular and constructive feedback and provide ideas you can implement right now to improve performance.</p>\r\n",
